# Names only. Never commit values.
#
# For the COS-PLUGIN-001 `plugin-local` environment, do not create .dev.vars
# by hand: run `./scripts/plugin-dev-up.sh` from the workspace root. It
# generates local-only random values into a gitignored mode-600 file and passes
# it to `wrangler dev --env-file`. It refuses to start while a .dev.vars file
# exists here, so production-shaped values cannot leak into the local Worker.
#
# For any other non-production use, write the file with mode 0600 from an
# approved non-production secret store; never reuse production values.

# Shared with the Robynn app; signs Worker -> app internal requests.
MCP_INTERNAL_AUTH_SECRET=

# CONNECTOR_STATE_SECRET is an app-side secret. It is not read by this Worker
# (COS-PLUGIN-001 P03) and must not be set here.
